      "id": "02",
      "title": "Tokenization and PCI scope",
      "question": "How do you keep raw card numbers out of most of your system?",
      "scenes": [
        {
          "type": "question",
          "say": "Question two. How do you keep raw card numbers out of almost all of your system, and why does it matter? Pause and answer out loud.",
